refactor: template reorganization, settings inlining, test fixes, and documentation

Template Cleanup (applications/assets/templates/):
- Deduplicated 60+ templates: consolidated errors/, newsletter/, privacy/, mfa/ into plugins/
- Merged LMS/ into lms/ (case-sensitivity fix)
- Removed 6 empty files and 2 copy-suffixed files
- Kept emails/ and components/pagination/ as backwards-compatible mirrors
- Fixed template reference paths (7 extends, 6 includes, 1 mfa include)

Settings Inlining:
- Inlined LMS_LOCAL_APPS from configs/base/lms.py into site settings (deleted)
- Inlined UNFOLD admin sidebar: shared baseline with auto-discovery, VResume override
- Inlined CELERY_BEAT_SCHEDULE: shared empty dict, VResume 5 tasks
- Deleted deprecated configs/base/storages.py (broken import, zero references)
- Removed dead imports from configs/base/admin_site.py

Documentation:
- Created 6 new docs: INDEX.md, websites.md, environments.md, packages.md, templates.md, README.md
- Updated assets/templates/AGENTS.md to point to new docs
- Copied docs to libs/django-osoul/docs/ and libs/ceptor-ai/docs/
- Created CHANGELOG.md

Test Fixes (30 failures -> 0):
- test_parser.py: updated for include-vs-comp fragment change
